["]The second form of correction is 'direct glazed' lenses,[ where] your prescription is fitted into the eyewear frame. Two brands that excel are[ Oak]ley and[ Mau]i Jim, both manufacturing[ wrap]-around lenses tailored to your prescription.
["Getting] your[ ski] goggles right is essential, when[ skiing] or[ snow]boarding a goggle has to be able to[ deliver] good peripheral view, air circulation ([to] combat fogging), comfort and due to the popularity of helmets now be ‘[hel]met compatible’.
