Kelly, Elena M. (DiBiase) of Jamaica Plain on January 21, 2012. Beloved wife of the late Daniel E. Kelly. Loving mother of Janet O’Brien and her husband Paul of[ Brock]ton and Daniel J. Kelly and his wife Gail of Sharon.
